+## 3. Summary Table
+
+| Action | Count | Items |
+|---|---|---|
+| **Remove** | 20 | All PHASE*/STEP* completion reports (14), CSCS/complex/UI-UX audit reports (3, optional archive), Elite deployment & enhancement summaries (2), settings summary (1) |
